(L1  Standard: general matter material, visible to L1 users.) Tj T*
(L2  Confidential: sensitive strategy and client information.) Tj T*
(L3  Restricted: highly sensitive material, view-only by default.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(L2 and L3 views always carry a mandatory watermark. L3 downloads) Tj T*
(are blocked unless the case explicitly allows them.) Tj T*
ET
