ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.25 rg
56 360 Td
17 TL
(Documents become visible only after a clean malware scan.) Tj T*
(Pending, failed and infected files never produce a signed URL.) Tj T*
(Quarantined files are retained for audit but are not deliverable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Transfers create external case membership only after the) Tj T*
(designated recipient accepts. Revocation severs future access.) Tj T*
ET
