(Every allowed view and download records an audit event before) Tj T*
(the signed URL is issued. Entries are append-only and linked by) Tj T*
(a hash chain; the chain is verified daily at 03:00 UTC.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Denials record a reason code such as CLEARANCE_MISMATCH,) Tj T*
(NOT_CASE_MEMBER or DOWNLOAD_BLOCKED_L3. Audit entries include) Tj T*
(the actor, case, document, approximate location and timestamp.) Tj T*
